The files under policies/ are copied unmodified (test files and READMEs left out)
from examples/policies/ in the Agent Governance Toolkit repository
(https://github.com/microsoft/agent-governance-toolkit, commit c767f83). They are
test fixtures: the importer test translates every one of them. They are not part
of AgentFox's Apache-2.0 licensed source.

